Patches
-------

- editor.tsx, accounts.tsx, file-tree.tsx: restyled with the playground's
  Tailwind tokens and `@/components/ui` Button/Input/Textarea. Only JSX
  markup and classNames changed (plus the three imports); state, effects and
  handlers are unchanged.
- function-cards.css: every selector prefixed with `.bal-bot-root`.
- bal-bot.css: extracted from upstream style.css: only flow, floating-chat,
  workspace-layout, anchor-activity and chat-markdown rules are kept, every
  selector is prefixed with `.bal-bot-root`, chat-markdown colours use the
  playground tokens, and a scoped button base for the flow panel replaces
  upstream's global `button` rule. Chrome rules were replaced by Tailwind
  classes; the global `:root`, `*`, `body` rules and the Google Fonts @import
  are dropped.
- Not copied: main.tsx (replaced by bal-bot-view.tsx), style.css (see above),
  vite-env.d.ts.
- tests/bal-bot: copied from upstream apps/editor/tests (variable-text from the
  repo-root tests/); import and fixture paths repointed to the components dir
  and packages/compiler/testdata/upstream. Skipped: hir-type-cast-render and
  post-baseline/template-rendering (need Playwright/Chromium), browser harness
  HTML/tsx files.
- All copied source, test, CSS and JSON files: formatted with this repository's Biome
  configuration, and Biome lint findings fixed (non-null assertions replaced
  with checked lookups, explicit button types, accessibility fixes, and
  justified `biome-ignore` comments where the rule does not apply).

